# Supabase connection for RSVPs. Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in.
# Find both values in Supabase: Project Settings -> API (or "Connect" -> App frameworks).
#
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL       Project URL, e.g. https://abcd1234.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  The public "anon" key (also called the "publishable" key).
#
# These are compiled into the public website, which is fine for the anon/publishable key:
# the database only lets it INSERT RSVPs (see supabase/migrations).
# NEVER put the service_role / secret key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
